            "review_title": "Review at Sin Restaurant",
            "review_text": "elyzia m\n2 contributions\n0\nGreat Food 😊\nJun 2025 • Family\nI love the food! 10/10. One of my favorites was one of the hot plate beef they served. It was juicy and tender. Not to mention, my family of 14 people went here, and they serve quick! Especially for a big family like mine. And Vietnam people don’t know English as much, so please understand them, they don’t mean to be rude but they try to be friendly and smile. I noticed this upon interacting with the staff but they try their best to speak the little English they know. The atmosphere was also calm and friendly. Thank you Sin!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nStaff could learn some basic English because of the communication barrier. But overall, they did great. Thank you!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 11, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
